fact WorkItem(id: "WI-694", description: some(value: "Reflect-builtin head-symbol extraction via ViewHead::functor_sym (WI-348 direction; audit follow-up). Four reflect builtins in resolve.rs -- builtin_provenance (3546), builtin_scope (5138), builtin_kind (5177), builtin_extract_sort (3494) -- reify a walked goal arg via reify_goal_value(self,&val) purely to destructure a head symbol with terms.get(t) matching Term::Ref(s)=>s / Term::Fn{functor}=>functor (else Failure). That is exactly ViewHead::functor_sym() (term_view.rs:70), which maps both Ref(s) and Functor{Some(s)} to the symbol for ANY carrier (Term/Node/Entity) with no reification. Replace each with 'let Some(sym)=val.head(self).functor_sym() else { return Failure }'. extract_sort also reads a nested SortView first-positional child's symbol -> inst.pos_arg(0).head(self).functor_sym(). BEHAVIORAL NUANCE (strict improvement): reify_goal_value PANICS on a non-goal Value (scalar/Entity); functor_sym returns None->clean Failure (correct relational semantics for a malformed reflect query, no resolver crash). Acceptance: full cargo-test green (esp. reflect/provenance/scope/kind/extract_sort tests + a SortView-shape extract_sort case)."), context: none, acceptance: [ToolPasses(tool: "cargo-test", params: none)], depends_on: some(value: nil), generates: none, requires_capability: none, status: Delivered(agent: "claude", at: "2026-07-12T09:17:17Z"))

