fact Feedback(workitem: "WI-694", author: "user", content: "DELIVERED 2026-07-12 (3f917d70). 4 reflect builtins in resolve.rs -- builtin_provenance(was 3546), builtin_scope(5138), builtin_kind(5177), builtin_extract_sort(3494) -- dropped reify_goal_value(self,&v)+terms.get(t){Ref(s)=>s|Fn{functor}=>functor|_=>Failure} for 'let Some(sym)=v.head(self).functor_sym() else {return Failure}'. extract_sort's SortView branch: match inst.head(self){ ViewHead::Ref(sym)=>Some(sym); ViewHead::Functor{functor:Some(functor),pos_arity,..}=> if name(functor)==SortView && pos_arity>0 {inst.pos_arg(self,0).and_then(|c| c.head(self).functor_sym())} else {Some(functor)}; _=>None }. functor_sym (term_view.rs:70, pub(crate)) unifies Ref(s)+Functor{Some(s)} for ALL carriers, byte-faithful to the old Ref/Fn arms; verified by reading all 4 sites. BEHAVIORAL NUANCE (strict improvement): reify_goal_value panics on a non-goal Value (scalar/entity); functor_sym returns None -> clean Failure (correct relational semantics for a malformed reflect query, no resolver crash). reify_goal_value stays live (route-handler 1255, is_entity_of 3473/3474). Full suite green: 73 binaries, 2735 passed, 0 failed; SortView branch covered by typing_test::extract_sort_ref_from_parameterized_type + wi230_requires_tree(4), Ref branch by extract_sort_ref_from_simple_ref, provenance by wi352_flow_derive_test::provenance_builtin_reads_symbol_kind. Audit follow-up: also corrected a stale WI-692 comment in execute.rs (separate commit 2c11befc, comment-only) -- the or-wrapper's term-interning is no longer forced now that push_choice is carrier-neutral. /code-review not re-run (4 mechanical sites over the established functor_sym primitive, all independently read + full suite green).", at: "2026-07-12T09:17:17Z")
